  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Major Mental Mutation</strong></p>\n<p>The whites of one of your eyes turn blood red and elicit a deeply unnerving feeling from anyone you rest your gaze upon. You may inflict crippling pain upon someone you look at. If you succeed with an <b>Opposed Willpower</b> Test the target doubles up in pain and gains 1 @Condition[Fatigued] Condition and must pass a <b>Hard (-20) Endurance</b> Test or gain the @Condition[Prone] Condition. If you fail the <b>Opposed Willpower</b> Test you gain 1 @Condition[Stunned] Condition. You can only gain this mutation twice.</p>"
